+
+## Deployment-only target visibility
+
+The local UI fork optionally accepts `SKILLSHARE_UI_HIDE_TARGETS`, a comma-separated
+list of exact, case-sensitive target names (surrounding whitespace is ignored).
+These entries are omitted from the available-target API, including discovery and
+the Add Target chooser. The default empty value preserves the upstream catalog.
+This is presentation filtering, not uninstall, authorization, or a change to
+configured targets, native adapters, CLI support, or shared skills directories.
